error[E0575]: invalid accessor override
 --> $DIR/override-ordinary-field.nra:8:15
  |
7 |     export let size: int = 0;
  |                ---- 'size' declares a field
8 |         | get.override: size;
  |               ^^^^^^^^ '.override' needs 'let.override'
  |
  = help: override an inherited property with 'export let.override size: T;' followed by its '.override' clauses

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0575`.
